msgid "BG Couriers for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: bg-couriers.php
msgid "https://github.com/dangoriaynov/bg-couriers"
msgstr "https://github.com/dangoriaynov/bg-couriers"

#. Description of the plugin
#: bg-couriers.php
msgid ""
"Shipping with Bulgarian couriers (Speedy, Econt, BOX NOW, Pigeon, Sameday) - "
"office/address/locker delivery, live rates, labels and tracking."
msgstr ""
"Доставка с български куриери (Speedy, Econt, BOX NOW, Pigeon, Sameday) - до "
"офис, до адрес и до автомат, живи цени, товарителници и проследяване."

#. Author of the plugin
#: bg-couriers.php
msgid "Дан Горяйнов"
msgstr "Дан Горяйнов"

